WEBVTT

00:07:59.246 --> 00:08:04.538
So I'm a bit curious to hear
more about the dichotomy of

00:08:04.538 --> 00:08:08.246
the distinction that you're
drawing between engagement

00:08:08.246 --> 00:08:10.871
and will be my interpretation
of engagement,

00:08:11.246 --> 00:08:13.996
whether it's fairly close
to wellbeing at work.

00:08:14.621 --> 00:08:18.413
Yeah, I think I think in large part it
depends on which conceptualization

00:08:18.413 --> 00:08:20.246
and measure of engagement
we're talking about.

00:08:20.246 --> 00:08:24.204
But one of the one of the more
interesting patterns in

00:08:24.204 --> 00:08:26.121
the literature that that's
gotten me thinking quite

00:08:26.121 --> 00:08:30.496
a bit is that it's possible to
be an engaged workaholic.